                                                "sense_id": "7e8ce197-6ce7-3501-b08e-c3b0b723f97f",
                                                "text": "Atwood's Edible Woman offers a brilliant analysis of woman as consumable in consumer capitalism: when Marian turns out in a tarty hairdo and red dress..."
